  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "One writer",
      "items": [
        "Handlers and activity tasks only append to _inbox; _run_form is the only place state changes",
        "_request waits for _replies[seq], so an Update returns after the loop has applied it and re-reconciled",
        "_apply re-runs check_submission: another Update may have landed since the validator ran"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "_reconcile(trigger)",
      "items": [
        "resolve_requirements over _data, _results, _actions and context",
        "Retire values of fields that stopped applying into _retained",
        "plan_actions, then _start_activity for every pending activity action",
        "Re-resolve, store _resolution, append explain() to _decisions (last 50)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Activity results",
      "items": [
        "Activity id is action id + attempt; the result is posted to the inbox, not applied in the task",
        "_apply stores it under _results[field][fingerprint]; stale if the current fingerprint differs",
        "Failure after retries marks the action failed; retry_action sets it back to pending"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "How a run ends",
      "items": [
        "_run_form closes the form: inactivity timeout → cancelled; complete → select_next",
        "run() then drains late requests (in a finally) with ApplicationClosed",
        "Waits for all_handlers_finished, then continue_as_new (with _next_input) or returns _outcome()"
      ]
    }
  ]
